{
  "slug": "softlight",
  "name": "Softlight",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generates and implements design directions for product design problems. Explores alternatives, makes code changes, and wires the app so you can see results immediately.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `clone-app` (Clone elements of an existing application to demonstrate a design problem and to use as the basis for…), `generate-mocks` (Create one focused set of live intake sketches from the transcript and screenshots), `generate-prototype` (Build a standalone prototype app from the baseline clone that implements a design idea, run it on its…), `present-canvas` (Own the canvas as a communication artifact), `run-designer-codegen` (Turn a Softlight design-jam transcript into three hi-fi prototype PRDs), `softlight` (Create a Softlight project backed by a long-running agent), `start-tunnel` (Create a tunnel between a local port and Softlight)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PreToolUse`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install softlight@claude-community` from `orianna-ai/claude-plugin` (`plugins/softlight`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
